  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The variation of stopping potential <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced></math> as a function of the frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#957;</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;of the incident light for a metal is shown in figure. The work function of the surface is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0045_175a9c1583dc.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 250px;\" /></p>"
  },
